Dragon Burst 0193: the UI watchdog is quiet while the app is off screen

With the app in the background SDL holds the UI thread in its pause (SDL_HINT_ANDROID_BLOCK_ON_PAUSE), so the
watchdog from 0192 (the PC's b5ef429) logged "the window hasn't answered for 5 s, 15 s, 30 s" on every Home.
SetUIWatchdogBackground (called by the app with the background pause) holds the reports and starts the count of a
stall again on return.

diff --git a/include/rex/ui/ui_watchdog.h b/include/rex/ui/ui_watchdog.h
--- a/include/rex/ui/ui_watchdog.h
+++ b/include/rex/ui/ui_watchdog.h
@@ -24,6 +24,10 @@
 // Starts the watchdog thread once (ui_watchdog cvar).
 void StartUIWatchdog();
 
+// Dragon Burst (Android): the app is off screen (SDL holds the UI thread in its pause); no reports meanwhile, and
+// the count of a stall starts again on return.
+void SetUIWatchdogBackground(bool background);
